# Not capable of being [[denied]], [[challenged]], or [[disputed]]; closed to [[questioning]].
#: {{syn|en|indisputable|undeniable|unquestionable}}
#: {{ant|en|controvertible}}
#: {{coi|en|'''incontrovertible''' evidence}}
#: {{ux|en|Her statement that dogs are mammals is '''incontrovertible'''.}}
