#* {{quote-journal|en|author=Coral Davenport; Lisa Friedman|title=Five Decades in the Making: Why It Took Congress So Long to Act on Climate|work=The New York Times|date=2022-08-07|url=https://www.nytimes.com/2022/08/07/climate/senate-climate-law.html|issn=0362-4331|passage=All said that the '''incontrovertible''' evidence that climate change has already arrived—in the form of frighteningly extreme wildfires, drought, storms and floods afflicting every corner of the United States—has helped build political support.}}

